    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_d4e378857153bcf5b3adf6764b9e156dcd38d917574c0510f9c14bb56b4a41d0",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The source builds a chained representation bridge: the failure of a consistent direct quantization of the dilation Hamiltonian motivates passing to its inverse; normal ordering and the sign Green kernel make that inverse a finite lattice matrix; a weighted, nonunitary rescaling maps each nonzero inverse-model eigenstate to a zero-energy RD state; and differentiating the continuum inverse equation recovers the formal generalized BK wavefunction.",
